  "details": "Lot of the times, especially Quest users, when paying for an avatar comission, do not have the means or knowhow how to upload an avatar (or a world) themselves.\nThis makes them give the creator  their login redentials, which is a potential safety risk.\nTo solve this issue, I think there should be an option on the VRChat website to create a 2nd login, that can be ONLY used for uploading avatars (and eventually worlds).\nThis will significantly reduce the risk of account theft etc, because the login will be used only for uploading content on the account.\nThere may also be an option to create a temporary uploading login/manually delete the 2nd login when not needed anymore.",
